            description: Some("Use this operation to suppress anomaly detection for a specified anomaly or pattern. If you suppress an anomaly, CloudWatch Logs won\'t report new occurrences of that anomaly and won\'t update that anomaly with new data. If you suppress a pattern, CloudWatch Logs won\'t report any anomalies related to that pattern. You must specify either anomalyId or patternId, but you can\'t specify both parameters in the same operation. If you have previously used this operation to suppress detection of a pattern or anomaly, you can use it again to cause CloudWatch Logs to end the suppression. To do this, use this operation and specify the anomaly or pattern to stop suppressing, and omit the suppressionType and suppressionPeriod parameters"),
